export const automaticIncomeRule="Personal hourly income is saved until you claim it, and the server also collects it into cash automatically every two hours, even while you are offline. Manual claims remain available at any time and do not move the automatic schedule. Prison and coma pause earnings and automatic payment. Full wallets keep unpaid income saved. The 24-active-hour accumulation cap remains a safety limit if automatic collection cannot complete.";
export const robberyRule="Successful player robberies steal 10\u2013100% of the target\u2019s cash, limited by the attacker\u2019s wallet space. Relative normal rank and Power affect success odds and the loot distribution. Before protection, success ranges from 30% to 80%; complete cash theft has only a 0.1\u20131% chance per successful robbery. Protection reduces success and the chance of full theft, but bank money and possessions cannot be stolen. Most successful robberies take a smaller share. Robbery cooldown is five minutes after failure and thirty minutes after success. Liquidation cooldown is thirty minutes after failure and twenty-four hours after success. Each operation has its own actor-wide timer: switching targets or pages cannot bypass it. Own-family targets remain protected.";
export const familyPublicRule="Click a family name in All families to open its public profile, with members, roles, Power, careers and possessions. Private requests, chat, staff controls and management permissions remain restricted.";

export const notificationRule="Important background events appear in Notification panel under My activity, with an unread counter. Read one notification or mark the displayed receipt range as read; history stays available. Personal attacks, liquidation and family notices do not open background popups. Success and failure results from your own risky actions remain. Optional NPC invitations first become eligible after ten minutes of online session time, then every fifteen online minutes from the last offer. Offline time does not count; a new online session starts with a ten-minute wait. Offers expire after ten minutes, do not reroll on refresh and are shown once per browser per offer. Real device push remains paused.";
